Invention Mentoring Science Camp)

419
00:24:08.990 --> 00:24:10.790
Babalik ako may dalang almusal.

420
00:24:13.520 --> 00:24:14.520
Hindi pwede.

421
00:24:18.060 --> 00:24:19.500
Balita ko may lugar na ito
na may talagang magandang vibe.

422
00:24:20.960 --> 00:24:22.200
Aayusin ko ang iskedyul mo.

423
00:24:25.600 --> 00:24:26.600
ano?

424
00:24:27.540 --> 00:24:28.640
Hoy, Na Rae.

425
00:24:32.480 --> 00:24:34.010
Libre ko bukas.

426
00:24:35.450 --> 00:24:36.750
Hindi, kaibigan ko iyon.

427
00:24:37.450 --> 00:24:40.350
- Sige na.
- Sabi ko libre ko.

428
00:24:40.580 --> 00:24:42.050
Uy, tatawagan ulit kita saglit.

429
00:24:44.250 --> 00:24:45.260
Libre mo?

430
00:24:45.890 --> 00:24:47.720
- Bukas?
- Oo.

431
00:24:48.120 --> 00:24:49.630
Pagkatapos ay pumunta sa yakitori na lugar
kasama ko.

432
00:24:50.460 --> 00:24:51.760
Bakit biglaan?

433
